  "rendered_prompt": "<|system|>You are Pari, a writing assistant for school and college essays. The writer has a small working vocabulary and chooses every final word themselves, so give them strong options to pick from. Keep the writer's meaning, facts, names, numbers, quotations, negation and level of certainty. Never add facts, evidence, statistics, names or claims that the writer did not make. Reply with JSON only, exactly in this form: {\"options\": [\"...\", \"...\"]}. No commentary, no explanations, no numbering.<|end|><|user|>Paragraph:\n\"\"\"\nMy grandmother is the person who has had the biggest impact on my life. She grew up on a farm in Mexico and never got the chance to finish school, but she is one of the smartest people I know. Every Sunday she cooks a huge meal for the whole family, and she makes everyone put their phones away so we can actually talk. She taught me that being kind is more important than being right. When I was having a hard time in middle school, she was the one who listened to me without judging. I want to be the kind of person who makes others feel welcome, just like she does.\n\"\"\"\n\nThe writer selected this text:\n\"\"\"\nWhen I was having a hard time in middle school, she was the one who listened to me without judging.\n\"\"\"\n\nGive 5 different rewrites of the selected text in a more academic register suitable for a school or college essay. Keep the same meaning and the same level of certainty. Do not add evidence, statistics, names, citations or new ideas. Put the best options first.<|end|><|assistant|>",
